          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma mpulira ekyashusha oti iraka ly'embaga mpango omw'iguru niligamba liti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omumalaika angambira ati, “Handika ekigambo eki: Baberwa abaraliziibwe aha muraagiro gw'obugenyi bw'obushwere bwa Kataama.” Ashuba angambira ati, “Ebigambo bya Ruhanga ebi by'amazima.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho mugwa omu maguru kumufukamira, kyonkai angambira ati, “Ebi otakubikora! Inye ndi mwiru mutahi wawe mara mutaahi wa barumuna bawe abakwete evangeli ya Kirisito. Ruhanga obe n'iwe ofukamira.” Kuba evangeli ya Kirisito niyo eshoboza abarangi kuranga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nirwo naboine eiguru likingukire, nkabona efarasi elikwera. Ayabaire agishuntamireho akaba nayetwa Mwesigwa mara Omunyamazima, omu kuramura n'omu kurashana wenene aba mugorogoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaisho nigashusha orulimi rw'omuliro, enkinga zitali zike zimuli aha mutwe; ainai eibara elimuhandikirweho ely'omuntu n'omoi atalikumanya shana wenene wenkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayambaire ekanzu eibikire omu bwamba, n'eibara nayetwa Kigambo wa Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahe g'omw'iguru, gajwete kitaani nungi, katare etainaimu katokoro, nigamuhondera gakuubire efarasi zilikwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kanwa yarugwamu embanda ehyoirwe ey'okwisa amahanga, mara amahanga ago aragatwaza enkoni y'ekyoma. Kandi eijungiro ly'edivai elilimu ekiniga kibi kya Ruhanga Rushoborabyona naija kulilibatilira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kanzuye n'aha kiberokye ahandikirweho eibara eli: Omukama w'abakama, Rugaba Nyamukuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshuba mbona omumalaika ayemeleire omw'izoba, ayeta muno amahungu gona agalikuharara eiguru ati, “Mwije, muhurure, mwije aha muraagiro katangaza gwa Ruhanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mulye abakama, abakuru b'amahe, abaisherukare, efarasi n'abazikuubire, abantu bona: Omwiru n'atali mwiru, na muke na muhango.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbona ekikaaka n'abakama b'ensi n'amahe gabo bahurwire kurashanisa ogwo asingiire aha farasi n'okurashanisa eihelye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekikaaka bakita omu ngaro, n'omurangi w'ebishuba abulimu ayakoraga eby'okutangaza omu maisho gakyo ebyo kyabeiyesaga ababaire bagiirweho akabonero kakyo n'abafukamiraga ekishushani kyakyo. Ekikaaka ekyo hamoi n'omurangi w'ebishuba akabanaga nibarora omu nyanja y'obuganga obulikwokya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abandi bakaitwa embanda y'ogwo asingire aha farasi; niyo mbanda elikumuruga omu kanwa; amahungu gabalya gaiguta gaigusire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
